{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 0, "start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 2.9000000953674316, "text": "Congratulations, class of 2006.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 1, "start_seconds": 2.9000000953674316, "end_seconds": 8.0, "text": "I can say without a doubt, you are graduating at one of the most opportune times in world history.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 8.0, "end_seconds": 10.0, "text": "The world is your oyster.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 10.0, "end_seconds": 12.0, "text": "When I was your age, things were different.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 4, "start_seconds": 12.0, "end_seconds": 16.0, "text": "I had to write my papers with an electric typewriter.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 16.0, "end_seconds": 21.0, "text": "When I started my company, Maximum Profit LLC, nobody trusted me.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 21.0, "end_seconds": 23.0, "text": "Except for my trust fund.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 23.0, "end_seconds": 25.0, "text": "Today, you can start a business with the snap of your fingers.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 25.0, "end_seconds": 29.0, "text": "With the rise of artificial intelligence, you don't need graphic designers,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 29.0, "end_seconds": 33.0, "text": "illustrators, copywriters, editors, or even coders.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 10, "start_seconds": 33.0, "end_seconds": 37.0, "text": "Sorry, I think people are yelling, Bruce, is Bruce Springsteen after me, guys?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 37.0, "end_seconds": 41.0, "text": "Anyways, AI is going to create a frictionless paradise for entrepreneurs.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 41.0, "end_seconds": 44.0, "text": "Oh, you guys are booing.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 13, "start_seconds": 44.0, "end_seconds": 46.0, "text": "Oh, should I keep going?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 14, "start_seconds": 46.0, "end_seconds": 48.0, "text": "Wait, you guys don't like AI?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 15, "start_seconds": 48.0, "end_seconds": 51.0, "text": "What's not to like? It's written most of your papers the past few years, I'm sure, right?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 16, "start_seconds": 51.0, "end_seconds": 54.0, "text": "Okay, look, I'm going to keep going, but I don't know why you people are mad.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 17, "start_seconds": 54.0, "end_seconds": 55.0, "text": "Let's see, let's see.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 18, "start_seconds": 55.0, "end_seconds": 57.0, "text": "AI will destroy the old world.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 19, "start_seconds": 57.0, "end_seconds": 61.0, "text": "Nobody will be employed because AI will eventually do every job.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 20, "start_seconds": 61.0, "end_seconds": 65.0, "text": "This path is inevitable, so you must work to carry forth this inevitability.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 21, "start_seconds": 65.0, "end_seconds": 66.0, "text": "Right?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 22, "start_seconds": 66.0, "end_seconds": 68.0, "text": "I thought you guys would love this.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 23, "start_seconds": 68.0, "end_seconds": 71.0, "text": "College education will become useless if it already hasn't.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 24, "start_seconds": 71.0, "end_seconds": 74.0, "text": "Your dreams of upward mobility have perished.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 25, "start_seconds": 74.0, "end_seconds": 76.0, "text": "Okay, I get why you're booing now.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "NBqmmyHlluI", "segment_index": 26, "start_seconds": 76.0, "end_seconds": 78.0, "text": "Sorry, and AI did write this.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
